# RaptorMod (AztMod) -- what stays OUT of the repo. See SETUP.md for where the big assets live instead.

# ---- backups and snapshots: git history replaces them ----
backup-*/
art-1024-backup/
art-800x600-backup/
checkpoints/
release/
*.aztbak
*.bak
AztMod.manifest.json.pre-*

# ---- per-machine and obsolete manifests ----
# (written by tools\Apply-Delta.ps1 on each machine: the baseline of what THAT install has)
AztMod.manifest.installed.json
AztMod.manifest.800x600.json
AztMod.diag.manifest.json

# ---- test and runtime output ----
tc-test/
*.log
*.tmp

# ---- derived on each machine by tools\Setup-Machine.ps1 ----
art/title/title-music.wav

# ---- by-products nothing reads ----
art/plates.json
art/preview-SAVE*.png
design/incoming/flat-art/

# ---- stale copies at the root (the notes live in docs/notes) ----
/MEMORY.md
/azrael-scene-graph.md

# ---- the game's own files never belong here (private repo or not) ----
*.EXE
*.exe
*.BIN
*.MOV
*.DAT

# ---- editors / OS ----
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vs/
.vscode/
*.bak-*

# Room Review's screenshots stay on each PC (the notes' JSON is versioned)
room-notes/*.png
